OL,3,AIran vows 'decisive response' to first
OL,4,AUS strikes in weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran and the US have traded fire after
OL,7,FAmerican forces struck two launchers on
OL,8,FLarak Island in the Strait of Hormuz,
OL,9,Faccording to a US official.
OL,11,FThe first known US strikes on Iran
OL,12,Fsince late July killed two people and
OL,13,Finjured two others, according to Iran's
OL,14,FIslamic Revolutionary Guard Corps
OL,15,F(IRGC), which vowed "response and
OL,16,Fpunishment".
OL,18,FUS Central Command said its forces had
OL,19,Ftaken "limited, precise action" against
OL,20,F"minelaying forces posing an imminent
OL,21,Fthreat in the Strait of Hormuz".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
